      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You glow a little. Sometimes metaphorically. Sometimes not.”</em></p><ul><li>You can cast <strong>calm emotions</strong> 1/Soma Break (Presence is your manifestation aptitude).</li><li>Allies within 2 squares reroll the lowest die on checks against being <strong>frightened</strong>.</li><li>You automatically sense the Sephirothic/Qliphothic tilt of any hex you enter.</li></ul>",
